---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Our Works - Ecorazón">
  <Header />

  <main class="works-page">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="works-hero">
      <div class="works-hero-content">
        <h1 class="works-hero-title animate-fade-in i18n-text-html" data-zh-html="身心可感受的健康<br />組織可衡量的成效">
          Wellness that people can feel<br />
          and organizations can measure
        </h1>
        <p class="works-hero-sub animate-fade-in-delay i18n-text" data-zh="Ecorazón 為企業策劃結合運動、創意實踐、自然體驗與專業支援的身心健康企劃。每個企劃皆圍繞您的團隊與業務需求量身打造，協助團隊重新調整步伐、建立連結，發展更健康的工作方式。">
          Ecorazón curates corporate wellness programmes that combine movement, creative practice, nature-based experiences and professional support. Built around your people and business priorities, each programme helps teams reset, reconnect and build healthier ways of working.
        </p>
        <a href="#wheel-section" class="hero-cta animate-fade-in-cta i18n-text js-scroll-cta" data-zh="精選體驗">Signature Experiences</a>
      </div>

      <div class="works-hero-media animate-fade-in-media">
        <div class="jelly-wrap">
          <video
            class="hero-jelly-video"
            autoplay
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            preload="auto"
            disablepictureinpicture
            disableRemotePlayback
          >
            <source src="/video/programme-hero.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Wellbeing Movement Intro -->
    <section class="wellbeing-section">
      <div class="wellbeing-photos">
        <div class="floating-photo photo-1"><div class="floating-photo-inner"><img src="/images/artists.jpg" alt="" /></div></div>
        <div class="floating-photo photo-2"><div class="floating-photo-inner"><img src="/images/artists.jpg" alt="" /></div></div>
        <div class="floating-photo photo-3"><div class="floating-photo-inner"><img src="/images/artists.jpg" alt="" /></div></div>
        <div class="floating-photo photo-4"><div class="floating-photo-inner"><img src="/images/artists.jpg" alt="" /></div></div>
        <div class="floating-photo photo-5"><div class="floating-photo-inner"><img src="/images/artists.jpg" alt="" /></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="wellbeing-inner">
        <div class="wellbeing-photos-mobile top">
          <div class="mobile-photo"><img src="/images/artists.jpg" alt="" /></div>
          <div class="mobile-photo"><img src="/images/artists.jpg" alt="" /></div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="wellbeing-title i18n-text" data-zh="身心共好行動">Ecorazón Wellbeing Movement</h2>
        <p class="wellbeing-desc i18n-text-html" data-zh-html="<strong>我們相信身心健康是基本需求，而非奢侈品。</strong><br /><br />Ecorazón 源於一個簡單的信念：人們不應該為了成功而與自己失去連結。在快節奏的世界裡，許多人默默承受著壓力、疲憊與焦慮。我們創造一個讓人們得以暫停、呼吸、重新連結並被看見的空間。<br /><br /><strong>我們不是來販賣健康的。<br />我們是來培養一種關懷的文化。</strong>">
          <strong>We believe wellbeing is a human need, not a luxury.</strong>
          <br /><br />
          Ecorazón began with a simple belief: people should not have to disconnect from themselves in order to succeed. In a fast-moving world, many carry stress, fatigue and pressure quietly. We create space for people to pause, breathe, reconnect and feel seen.
          <br /><br />
          <strong>We are not here to sell wellness.<br />We are here to cultivate a culture of care.</strong>
        </p>

        <div class="wellbeing-photos-mobile bottom">
          <div class="mobile-photo"><img src="/images/artists.jpg" alt="" /></div>
          <div class="mobile-photo"><img src="/images/artists.jpg" alt="" /></div>
          <div class="mobile-photo"><img src="/images/artists.jpg" alt="" /></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- H.E.A.R.T. Framework -->
    <section class="heart-framework-section">

      <!-- Left: copy + nav -->
      <div class="heart-content">
        <p class="heart-eyebrow scroll-reveal">The H.E.A.R.T. Framework</p>
        <h2 class="heart-title scroll-reveal">
          One H.E.A.R.T. Framework,<br />
          Five ways to support your people
        </h2>
        <p class="heart-desc scroll-reveal">
          From physical foundations and active self-care to creativity, meaningful connection
          and professional development, H.E.A.R.T. turns wellness into practical experiences
          your team can use at work and beyond.
        </p>

        <div class="heart-circles-row scroll-reveal">
          <div class="heart-circles" role="tablist" aria-label="H.E.A.R.T. pillars">
            <button class="pillar-circle active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-name="Health" data-title="Health, Habits & Healing" style="background-image:url('/images/4.png');"><span class="letter">H</span></button>
            <button class="pillar-circle" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-name="Energy" data-title="Exercise, Engagement & Empowerment" style="background-image:url('/images/16.jpg');"><span class="letter">E</span></button>
            <button class="pillar-circle" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-name="Art" data-title="Arts, Action & Appreciation" style="background-image:url('/images/17.jpg');"><span class="letter">A</span></button>
            <button class="pillar-circle" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-name="Relationships" data-title="Retreat, Resilience & Relationships" style="background-image:url('/images/2.png');"><span class="letter">R</span></button>
            <button class="pillar-circle" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-name="Talent" data-title="Training, Therapy & Transformation" style="background-image:url('/images/artists.jpg');"><span class="letter">T</span></button>
          </div>
          <p class="heart-pillar-label" id="heartPillarLabel">Health, Habits &amp; Healing</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: big tilted card stack -->
      <div class="heart-visual scroll-reveal">
        <div class="heart-stack" id="heartStack">
          <button class="stack-card" data-name="Health" data-blurb="Physical foundations" style="background-image:url('/images/4.png');"></button>
          <button class="stack-card" data-name="Energy" data-blurb="Active self-care" style="background-image:url('/images/16.jpg');"></button>
          <button class="stack-card" data-name="Art" data-blurb="Creative practice" style="background-image:url('/images/17.jpg');"></button>
          <button class="stack-card" data-name="Relationships" data-blurb="Meaningful connection" style="background-image:url('/images/2.png');"></button>
          <button class="stack-card" data-name="Talent" data-blurb="Professional development" style="background-image:url('/images/artists.jpg');"></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- H.E.A.R.T. Wheel -->
    <section class="wheel-section" id="wheel-section">
      <div class="wheel-inner">
        <p class="wheel-eyebrow scroll-reveal">The H.E.A.R.T. Framework</p>
        <h2 class="wheel-title scroll-reveal" id="wheelTitle">Health, Habits &amp; Healing</h2>
        <p class="wheel-desc scroll-reveal" id="wheelDesc">Supporting everyday energy, rest and physical wellbeing as the basis for a sustainable working life.</p>

        <div class="wheel-cards-row scroll-reveal" id="wheelCardsRow">
          <div class="wheel-card">
            <div class="wheel-card-img"><img src="/images/4.png" alt="" /></div>
            <p class="wheel-card-caption">Yoga</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wheel-card">
            <div class="wheel-card-img"><img src="/images/16.jpg" alt="" /></div>
            <p class="wheel-card-caption">Dance</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wheel-card">
            <div class="wheel-card-img"><img src="/images/artists.jpg" alt="" /></div>
            <p class="wheel-card-caption">Sleep</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wheel-card">
            <div class="wheel-card-img"><img src="/images/2.png" alt="" /></div>
            <p class="wheel-card-caption">Stretching</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="wheel-tabs scroll-reveal" id="wheelTabs" role="tablist" aria-label="H.E.A.R.T. pillars">
          <div class="wheel-tabs-indicator" id="wheelTabsIndicator"></div>

          <button class="wheel-tab active" data-key="H" role="tab" aria-selected="true">H</button>
          <button class="wheel-tab" data-key="E" role="tab" aria-selected="false">E</button>
          <button class="wheel-tab" data-key="A" role="tab" aria-selected="false">A</button>
          <button class="wheel-tab" data-key="R" role="tab" aria-selected="false">R</button>
          <button class="wheel-tab" data-key="T" role="tab" aria-selected="false">T</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Ways to Bring H.E.A.R.T. to Your Team -->
    <section class="wrk-section bg-warm cards-switch-section">
      <div class="wrk-inner">
        <div class="cards-switch-head">
          <div>
            <h2 class="section-title scroll-reveal">Ways to Bring H.E.A.R.T. to Your Team</h2>
            <p class="section-sub scroll-reveal">However much time and space you have, we shape a format around your team and your goals.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cards-switch-nav scroll-reveal">
            <button class="cards-arrow prev" aria-label="Scroll formats left">←</button>
            <button class="cards-arrow next" aria-label="Scroll formats right">→</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cards-switch-viewport scroll-reveal">
          <div class="cards-switch-track" id="formatsTrack">

            <div class="format-card">
              <span class="format-index">01</span>
              <h3 class="format-name">Half-Day Reset</h3>
              <p class="format-desc">A focused single session — movement, breathwork or a creative activity — built to fit around a busy work day.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="format-card">
              <span class="format-index">02</span>
              <h3 class="format-name">Multi-Day Programme</h3>
              <p class="format-desc">A series of sessions across several weeks, layering the H.E.A.R.T. pillars so new habits have time to stick.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="format-card">
              <span class="format-index">03</span>
              <h3 class="format-name">Off-Site Retreat</h3>
              <p class="format-desc">An immersive day or overnight retreat combining nature, movement and reflection away from the office.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="format-card">
              <span class="format-index">04</span>
              <h3 class="format-name">Ongoing Partnership</h3>
              <p class="format-desc">Regular touchpoints across the year, so wellbeing becomes part of how your team works, not a one-off event.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="format-card">
              <span class="format-index">05</span>
              <h3 class="format-name">Custom Activation</h3>
              <p class="format-desc">A one-off experience designed around a specific milestone — a launch, an offsite, or an internal campaign.</p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Testimonials -->
    <section class="wrk-section bg-white testi-section">
      <div class="wrk-inner">
        <div class="testi-head">
          <h2 class="section-title scroll-reveal">What people experience with Ecorazón</h2>
          <p class="section-sub scroll-reveal">From HR leads booking their first reset to founders building ongoing wellbeing programmes — here's how teams describe working with us.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="testi-grid scroll-reveal">
          <div class="testi-card">
            <p class="testi-quote">We use Laughter Yoga as a dynamic group session that combines stress-relief training with team-building. It trains the body to release stress, provides a therapeutic emotional release, and uses shared joy to instantly unify the team.</p>
            <div class="testi-footer">
              <img src="/images/bnw-logo.png" alt="" class="testi-logo" />
              <span class="testi-company">Company Name</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testi-card">
            <p class="testi-quote">We use Laughter Yoga as a dynamic group session that combines stress-relief training with team-building. It trains the body to release stress, provides a therapeutic emotional release, and uses shared joy to instantly unify the team.</p>
            <div class="testi-footer">
              <img src="/images/bnw-logo.png" alt="" class="testi-logo" />
              <span class="testi-company">Company Name</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testi-card">
            <p class="testi-quote">We use Laughter Yoga as a dynamic group session that combines stress-relief training with team-building. It trains the body to release stress, provides a therapeutic emotional release, and uses shared joy to instantly unify the team.</p>
            <div class="testi-footer">
              <img src="/images/bnw-logo.png" alt="" class="testi-logo" />
              <span class="testi-company">Company Name</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testi-card">
            <p class="testi-quote">We use Laughter Yoga as a dynamic group session that combines stress-relief training with team-building. It trains the body to release stress, provides a therapeutic emotional release, and uses shared joy to instantly unify the team.</p>
            <div class="testi-footer">
              <img src="/images/bnw-logo.png" alt="" class="testi-logo" />
              <span class="testi-company">Company Name</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testi-card">
            <p class="testi-quote">We use Laughter Yoga as a dynamic group session that combines stress-relief training with team-building. It trains the body to release stress, provides a therapeutic emotional release, and uses shared joy to instantly unify the team.</p>
            <div class="testi-footer">
              <img src="/images/bnw-logo.png" alt="" class="testi-logo" />
              <span class="testi-company">Company Name</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- CTA + Footer now share the last viewport together -->
  <div class="cta-footer-wrap">
    <section class="cta-section text-center">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6 tracking-wide parallax-text">
          READY TO TRANSFORM YOUR WORKPLACE CULTURE?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed parallax-text">
          Let's co-create gifts and experiences that inspire, empower, and sustain.
        </p>
        <a href="/get-in-touch" class="cta-btn">Get in Touch</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Footer />
  </div>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .works-page {
    padding-top: 72px;
  }

  /* ─── HERO ─── */
  html {
    scroll-snap-type: y mandatory;
    scroll-behavior: auto;
  }

  .works-hero,
  .wrk-section,
  .wellbeing-section,
  .heart-framework-section,
  .wheel-section {
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    scroll-snap-stop: always;
  }

  .works-hero {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      #C7DBA9 0%,
      #D8E6BF 8%,
      #EAE8C1 16%,
      #F5DBBE 26%,
      #F8DBC1 32%,
      #FBEAD6 40%,
      #FAF5F0 46%,
      #F8F8F8 54%,
      #F8F8F8 100%
    );
    height: 100vh;
    padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem) clamp(2rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .works-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 1000px;
    flex: 1 1 500px;
  }

  .works-hero-title {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3.3vw, 2.3rem);
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .works-hero-sub {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 1.3vw, 1rem);
    color: #1a1a1a;
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
    max-width: 520px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #ffffff;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    transition: background 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .hero-cta:hover {
    background: #C08EA4;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* ─── HERO MEDIA / ROTATING JELLY VIDEO ─── */
  .works-hero-media {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    flex: 0 1 380px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .jelly-wrap {
    width: clamp(280px, 34vw, 520px);
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #FCFCFB;
  }

  .hero-jelly-video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    pointer-events: none; /* no click-to-pause / native controls interaction */
  }

  .hero-jelly-video::-webkit-media-controls,
  .hero-jelly-video::-webkit-media-controls-start-playback-button {
    display: none !important;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
  }

  /* ─── HERO ENTRY ANIMATION ─── */
  @keyframes fadeInDown {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-16px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to   { opacity: 1; }
  }

  .animate-fade-in        { animation: fadeInDown 0.8s ease-out 0.15s both; }
  .animate-fade-in-delay  { animation: fadeInDown 0.8s ease-out 0.35s both; }
  .animate-fade-in-cta    { animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out 0.55s both; }
  .animate-fade-in-media  { animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease-out 0.4s both; }

  /* ─── WELLBEING MOVEMENT INTRO ─── */
  .wellbeing-section {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #E8E8E5 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: clamp(6rem, 10vh, 9rem) clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
  }

  .wellbeing-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 760px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .wellbeing-title {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 2.75rem);
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 2.25rem 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .wellbeing-desc {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.3vw, 1.05rem);
    color: #1a1a1a;
    opacity: 0.75;
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .wellbeing-desc strong {
    opacity: 1;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Floating reference photos (desktop only) */
  .wellbeing-photos {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .floating-photo {
    position: absolute;
  }

  .floating-photo-inner {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 14px;
  }

  .floating-photo-inner::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: -10px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10);
    filter: blur(24px);
    border-radius: inherit;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .floating-photo-inner img {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    border-radius: inherit;
  }

  /* Bigger photo = closer to front (higher z-index), smaller = further back */
  .photo-1 { top: 6%;  left: 7%;  width: 180px; height: 220px; z-index: 4; }
  .photo-2 { top: 10%; right: 8%; width: 220px; height: 260px; z-index: 5; }
  .photo-3 { bottom: 8%; left: 10%; width: 150px; height: 120px; z-index: 2; }
  .photo-4 { bottom: 6%; right: 6%; width: 175px; height: 210px; z-index: 3; }
  .photo-5 { top: 44%; left: 2%; width: 120px; height: 150px; z-index: 1; }

  /* Mobile-only intro photo rows (hidden on desktop) */
  .wellbeing-photos-mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .mobile-photo {
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .mobile-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .photo-1, .photo-2, .photo-3, .photo-4, .photo-5 {
      width: 110px;
      height: 140px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .wellbeing-photos { display: none; }
  }

  /* ─── H.E.A.R.T. FRAMEWORK SECTION ─── */
  .heart-framework-section {
    background: #F1F0EC;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 690px) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    column-gap: clamp(3rem, 5.5vw, 5.5rem);
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) clamp(3rem, 8vw, 9rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) clamp(2rem, 6vw, 7rem);
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ── Copy (grid col 1, row 1) ── */
  .heart-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .heart-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    opacity: 0.4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .heart-title {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    color: #1a1a1a;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .heart-desc {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 1vw, 1rem);
    color: #1a1a1a;
    opacity: 0.65;
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Right: big tilted card stack (grid col 2, row 1) ── */
  .heart-visual {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 460px;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .heart-stack {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
    transform-origin: center;
  }

  .stack-card {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 55px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
    transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1), opacity 0.6s ease;
  }

  .stack-card[data-position="0"] { transform: translate(0%, 0%)   rotate(0deg)   scale(1);    opacity: 1;    z-index: 5; }
  .stack-card[data-position="1"] { transform: translate(9%, 7%)   rotate(5deg)   scale(0.94); opacity: 0.85; z-index: 4; }
  .stack-card[data-position="2"] { transform: translate(17%, 13%) rotate(9deg)   scale(0.88); opacity: 0.55; z-index: 3; }
  .stack-card[data-position="3"] { transform: translate(22%, 17%) rotate(12deg)  scale(0.82); opacity: 0;    z-index: 2; pointer-events: none; }
  .stack-card[data-position="4"] { transform: translate(22%, 17%) rotate(12deg)  scale(0.82); opacity: 0;    z-index: 1; pointer-events: none; }

  .stack-card.exit-left {
    transition: none;
    animation: cardExitLeft 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1) forwards;
    z-index: 6;
  }

  @keyframes cardExitLeft {
    0%   { transform: translate(0%, 0%)   rotate(0deg)   scale(1);    opacity: 1; }
    55%  { transform: translate(-68%, 4%) rotate(-16deg) scale(0.88); opacity: 0.5; }
    100% { transform: translate(22%, 17%) rotate(12deg)  scale(0.82); opacity: 0; }
  }

  .stack-card.enter-left {
    transition: none;
    animation: cardEnterLeft 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1) forwards;
    z-index: 6;
  }

  @keyframes cardEnterLeft {
    0%   { transform: translate(22%, 17%) rotate(12deg)  scale(0.82); opacity: 0; }
    45%  { transform: translate(-68%, 4%) rotate(-16deg) scale(0.88); opacity: 0.5; }
    100% { transform: translate(0%, 0%)   rotate(0deg)   scale(1);    opacity: 1; }
  }

  /* ── Circle nav row ── */
  .heart-circles-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .heart-pillar-label {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    opacity: 0.45;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    min-height: 1.2em; /* prevents layout jump between short/long titles */
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .heart-circles {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .pillar-circle {
    position: relative;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    transform: scale(1);
    transform-origin: center;
    transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.4, 0.64, 1);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .pillar-circle::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ACADA5;
    opacity: 1;
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
  }

  .pillar-circle .letter {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .pillar-circle.active {
    transform: scale(1.4);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .pillar-circle.active::before {
    opacity: 0.28;
  }

  /* ─── H.E.A.R.T. WHEEL ─── */
  .wheel-section {
    position: relative;
    min-height: auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #FBF8F3;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4rem) clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem) clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .wheel-inner {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .wheel-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    opacity: 0.4;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  }

  .wheel-title {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.6vw, 2.2rem);
    color: #E2954E;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color 0.5s ease;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
  .wheel-title { font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 4vw, 1.3rem); }
}

  .wheel-desc {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.3vw, 1.05rem);
    color: #1a1a1a;
    opacity: 0.65;
    line-height: 1.85;
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem) auto;
    min-height: 3.7rem;
  }

  .wheel-carousel {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: clamp(0.75rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    /* break out of the 720px .wheel-inner text column so the wheel can be
      as wide as the viewport, independent of the copy above it */
    width: 100vw;
    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
    margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw);
  }

  .wheel-arc-line {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .wheel-arrow {
    width: 2.6rem;
    height: 2.6rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
    background: transparent;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    font-size: 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .wheel-arrow:hover {
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border-color: #1a1a1a;
    color: #ffffff;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .wheel-letter-static {
    position: absolute;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translateY(-22px); /* lifts letter above the line/dot */
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.4vw, 1.15rem);
    color: #1a1a1a;
    opacity: 0.32;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease, color 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.4,0.64,1);
  }

  .wheel-letter-static.active {
    opacity: 1;
    color: var(--pillar-color, #E2954E);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translateY(-22px) scale(1.2);
  }

  .wheel-item.active .wheel-dot {
    background: var(--pillar-color, #E2954E);
    transform: scale(1.35);
  }

  .wheel-item.active .wheel-circle {
    transform: scale(1);
    opacity: 1;
    color: var(--pillar-color, #E2954E);
    border-color: transparent;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12), inset 0 0 0 2px var(--pillar-color, #E2954E);
  }

  .wheel-item.active .wheel-letter {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .wheel-cards-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: clamp(0.9rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    margin: 0 auto clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem) auto;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .wheel-card {
    width: clamp(105px, 11vw, 148px);
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4.3;
    border-radius: 34px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.4,0.64,1), box-shadow 0.35s ease;
  }

  .wheel-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
  }

  .wheel-card-img {
    flex: 0 0 80%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .wheel-card-img img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .wheel-card-caption {
    flex: 0 0 20%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 0.4rem;
  }

  .wheel-tabs {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.4rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .wheel-tabs-indicator {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.4rem;
    left: 0.4rem;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--pillar-color, #E2954E);
    transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1), background 0.4s ease;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .wheel-tab {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: none;
    background: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    opacity: 0.4;
    transition: color 0.4s ease, opacity 0.4s ease;
  }

  .wheel-tab.active {
    color: #ffffff;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .wheel-tabs-indicator,
    .wheel-tab {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
    }
    .wheel-tab { font-size: 0.95rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .wheel-card { width: clamp(78px, 20vw, 100px); border-radius: 24px; }
    .wheel-card-caption { font-size: 0.7rem; }
    .wheel-letter-static { font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .wheel-arc-wrap { width: min(640px, 98vw); }
    .wheel-circle { width: 68px; height: 68px; }
    .wheel-item { padding-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  }

  /* ─── WAYS TO BRING H.E.A.R.T. (CARD SWITCHER) ─── */
  .cards-switch-section {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .cards-switch-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cards-switch-head .section-title,
  .cards-switch-head .section-sub {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .cards-switch-nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .cards-arrow {
    width: 2.6rem;
    height: 2.6rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
    background: transparent;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    font-size: 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cards-arrow:hover {
    background: #95BD8D;
    border-color: #95BD8D;
    color: #ffffff;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .cards-switch-viewport {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .cards-switch-viewport::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .cards-switch-track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .format-card {
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: clamp(220px, 22vw, 258px);
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .format-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .format-index {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #95BD8D;
  }

  .format-name {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .format-desc {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #000000;
    opacity: 0.6;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .format-card { width: clamp(210px, 78vw, 258px); }
  }

  /* ─── SECTIONS ─── */
  .wrk-section {
    padding: 5rem clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
  }

  .bg-white { background: #ffffff; }
  .bg-warm  { background: #f7f5f0; }
  .bg-dark  { background: #95BD8D; }

  .wrk-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ─── TYPOGRAPHY ─── */
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .section-sub {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #000000;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin: 0 0 3rem 0;
    max-width: 560px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ─── TESTIMONIALS ─── */
  .testi-section {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .testi-head {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .testi-grid {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .testi-grid::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .testi-card {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: clamp(220px, 22vw, 300px);
    min-height: 480px;
    background: #F2F1ED;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    overflow: hidden;
    cursor: default;
    transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.4, 0.64, 1), box-shadow 0.35s ease;
  }

  /* gradient lives behind the footer only — hidden by default */
  .testi-card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 55%;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, #E8944B 0%, #F2B673 35%, rgba(242, 182, 115, 0) 100%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
    border-radius: 0 0 20px 20px;
  }

  .testi-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .testi-card:hover::after {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .testi-quote {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .testi-footer {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    transition: color 0.4s ease;
  }

  .testi-card:hover .testi-footer {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .testi-logo {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: #ffffff;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .testi-company {
    font-family: 'MaoWei', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .testi-card {
      width: clamp(220px, 78vw, 300px);
    }
  }

  /* ─── SCROLL REVEAL ─── */
  .scroll-reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(28px);
    transition: opacity 0.7s ease-out, transform 0.7s ease-out;
  }

  .scroll-reveal.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  /* ─── CTA + FOOTER WRAP ─── */
  .cta-footer-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 100vh;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    scroll-snap-stop: always;
  }

  .cta-footer-wrap > * {
    flex-shrink: 0; /* footer keeps its natural height, never gets squeezed */
  }

  .cta-section {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 4rem 0;
    background: linear-gradient(-45deg, #7ACC86, #CE508F, #8AF3FF, #EB9C2E);
    background-size: 400% 400%;
    animation: gradientShift 8s ease infinite;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  @keyframes gradientShift {
    0%   { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    50%  { background-position: 100% 50%; }
    100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
  }

  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #000000;
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 0px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     MOBILE (≤ 900px)
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {

    /* ── Hero: vertical gradient, title on colour, video on grey ── */
    .works-hero {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      height: 100vh;
      height: 100dvh; /* real mobile viewport, avoids browser-chrome overflow */
      min-height: unset;
      max-height: 100vh;
      max-height: 100dvh;
      overflow: hidden;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        #C7DBA9 0%,
        #D8E6BF 6%,
        #EAE8C1 12%,
        #F5DBBE 18%,
        #F8DBC1 22%,
        #FBEAD6 26%,
        #FAF5F0 29%,
        #F8F8F8 30%,
        #F8F8F8 100%
      );
    }

    .works-hero-content {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      order: initial;
    }

    .works-hero-sub {
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .works-hero-media {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      order: initial;
      margin: 0 -1.5rem; /* cancel the section's left/right padding */
      width: calc(100% + 3rem); /* stretch back out to full viewport width */
    }

    .jelly-wrap {
      width: 100%; /* fill the full bleed width */
    }

    /* ── Intro: photos split above and below the text ── */
    .wellbeing-photos { display: none; }

    .wellbeing-photos-mobile {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .wellbeing-photos-mobile.top .mobile-photo:nth-child(1) {
      width: 84px; height: 104px;
      transform: translateY(14px);
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .wellbeing-photos-mobile.top .mobile-photo:nth-child(2) {
      width: 112px; height: 136px;
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .wellbeing-photos-mobile.bottom {
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .wellbeing-photos-mobile.bottom .mobile-photo:nth-child(1) {
      width: 70px; height: 88px;
      transform: translateY(-10px);
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .wellbeing-photos-mobile.bottom .mobile-photo:nth-child(2) {
      width: 100px; height: 122px;
      transform: translateY(10px);
      z-index: 3;
    }
    .wellbeing-photos-mobile.bottom .mobile-photo:nth-child(3) {
      width: 60px; height: 76px;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      z-index: 2;
    }

    /* ── H.E.A.R.T. Framework: text above, switching cards below ── */
    .heart-framework-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .heart-content {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 1;
    }

    .heart-visual {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 2;
      max-width: 260px;
      margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
    }

    .heart-desc { max-width: 100%; }

    /* ── Ways to Bring H.E.A.R.T. + Testimonials: keep text on-screen ── */
    .cards-switch-head,
    .testi-head {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .cards-switch-head > div,
    .testi-head {
      min-width: 0;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .section-title,
    .section-sub {
      min-width: 0;
      max-width: 100%;
      overflow-wrap: break-word;
      word-break: break-word;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .wrk-inner,
    .wrk-section {
      min-width: 0;
      max-width: 100%;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ── Footer: release the scroll-snap lock so it can't get stuck ── */
